{
  "file" : "npc/cities/alberta.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabian]",
      "translation" : "[法比安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Man... When you travel all around the world, you'll hear of some crazy things.",
      "translation" : "唉...走遍世界各地，總會聽到一些稀奇古怪的事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabian]",
      "translation" : "[法比安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Once, I heard that there are Cards which contain the power of monsters. If someone happens to get their hands on a card, they'll be able to use that monster's power.",
      "translation" : "我聽說有些卡片裡封存著魔物的力量。要是誰拿到了那種卡片，就能使用對應魔物的力量。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabian]",
      "translation" : "[法比安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm guessing it's some sort of fad or scam, where they make you collect all the cards or whatever. I mean, how can a card really hold the power of a monster?!",
      "translation" : "我猜這不過是某種風潮或騙局，騙大家去收集所有卡片之類的。我的意思是，卡片怎麼可能真的裝著魔物的力量？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fabian]",
      "translation" : "[法比安]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Seriously...",
      "translation" : "真是..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Steiner]",
      "translation" : "[施泰納]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh...!",
      "translation" : "哦...！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Alberta,",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到阿爾貝塔，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "young adventurer!",
      "translation" : "年輕的冒險者！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Steiner]",
      "translation" : "[施泰納]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pardon me if I seem distracted. I'm milling about, trying to make a plan. You see, I hear that there is a store in Geffen that sells armor that is resistant to magic.",
      "translation" : "如果我看起來心不在焉，還請見諒。我正在四處琢磨計劃。聽說吉芬有家商店賣一種能抵禦魔法的鎧甲。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Steiner]",
      "translation" : "[施泰納]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If I buy a lot of them in bulk, and then resell them here for a higher price...",
      "translation" : "要是我大量買進，再拿到這裡高價轉賣..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Chad]",
      "translation" : "[查德]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "People say the legendary weapon Gungnir never misses its target. I wonder if it's possibly true...",
      "translation" : "大家都說傳說中的武器岡格尼爾從不失手。不知道這說法是不是真的..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Chad]",
      "translation" : "[查德]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "People also say that babies are assembled by the storks before delivery, girls dig guys who act like jerks, and that Santa Claus exists! But only in Lutie.",
      "translation" : "大家還說，送來的嬰兒都是鸛鳥組裝的，女孩喜歡壞小子，還有聖誕老人真的存在！不過聖誕老人只在盧蒂出現！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Chad]",
      "translation" : "[查德]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I wonder...",
      "translation" : "我真想知道..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If any of that",
      "translation" : "這些說法"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "is possibly",
      "translation" : "到底有幾分"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "true...",
      "translation" : "是真的..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^666666*Hiccup*^000000",
      "translation" : "^666666*嗝*^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wh-what are you",
      "translation" : "你、你在"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "staring at? Get lost!!",
      "translation" : "看什麼？快滾開！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Say nothing.",
      "translation" : "什麼也不說。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Leave him alone.",
      "translation" : "別理他。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hahahaha ^666666*hiccup*^000000... You've got some nerve. I may look worthless now, but I used to be a sailor on the 'Going Mary.'",
      "translation" : "哈哈哈哈 ^666666*嗝*^000000...你膽子不小嘛。我現在看起來也許一文不值，但以前可是“瑪麗號”上的水手。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Never heard of it.",
      "translation" : "從沒聽說過。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Really? No kidding!",
      "translation" : "真的？不會吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Never heard of it?! Everybody knows th'notorious pirate ship 'Going Mary!' ^666666*Hiccup~*^000000",
      "translation" : "沒聽說過？！“瑪麗號”海盜船可是惡名遠揚，誰都知道！^666666*打嗝~*^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah~ The ol'days. If only... If only we hadn't run into that STORM...^666666*hiccup*^000000",
      "translation" : "啊~那段舊日時光。要是...要是當年沒遇上那場暴風雨...^666666*嗝*^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "AH~ Captain. I miss our cap'n more than anything... No foe survived before cap'n's sword.",
      "translation" : "啊~船長。我最想念船長了...在船長的劍下，沒有敵人能活下來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That's right! NOBODY meshes with the crew of the 'Going Mary!' And nobody can beat out cap'n in a sword fight!",
      "translation" : "沒錯！沒有人能和“瑪麗號”的船員比肩！劍術對決中，也沒人贏得過船長！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "CAPTAIN~!!! ^666666*HICCUP~*^000000 He would swing his sword like this, then... THEN!!",
      "translation" : "船長~！！！^666666*嗝~*^000000他揮劍時就像這樣，然後...然後！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The bastard the captain was fighting, and anyone of his friends near him, were surrounded in flame!",
      "translation" : "船長交手的那個混蛋，還有他身邊的同夥，全都被火焰吞沒了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Man, that sword must have had some sort of mysterious power, or the captain was just that good...!",
      "translation" : "那把劍一定藏著某種神秘力量，或者船長實在太厲害了...！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Phew~~ ^666666*Sob* *Sob...*^000000 God, I miss everyone! Now I'm depressed! Please, go away now.",
      "translation" : "呼~~^666666*嗚嗚* *抽泣...*^000000天啊，我好想念大家！我現在心情糟透了！請你走開吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Deagle]",
      "translation" : "[迪格爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That's right!",
      "translation" : "沒錯！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go AWAY~",
      "translation" : "快走開~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Shakir]",
      "translation" : "[沙基爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We Merchants have our own negotiating skill when we sell goods. This skill can get us more money than when other people sell goods.",
      "translation" : "我們商人出售商品時有自己的談價技巧。用這項技能，我們能比其他人賣出更高的價格。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Shakir]",
      "translation" : "[沙基爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's more than just yelling 'You'll have to give more money please!' You need to have charisma, and master rhetoric!",
      "translation" : "這可不只是大喊“請再多給點錢！”你得有魅力，還要精通說服之道！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Shakir]",
      "translation" : "[沙基爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We can get up to 24 % more zeny with this incredible skill. But remember to train hard to acquire it!!",
      "translation" : "靠這項厲害的技能，我們最多能多賺24%的澤尼。不過別忘了，想學會它就得勤加練習！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We Merchants can",
      "translation" : "我們商人可以"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "open roadside stands",
      "translation" : "擺設露天商店"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "to do business.",
      "translation" : "來做生意。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Shakir]",
      "translation" : "[沙基爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "With the Discount skill, we can buy goods really cheap from the stores in towns and load them into the cart we rent.",
      "translation" : "學會折扣技能後，我們就能在城鎮商店低價買進商品，再把它們裝進租來的手推車裡。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Shakir]",
      "translation" : "[沙基爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then afterwards, we can travel anywhere, and sells our goods to make a profit!",
      "translation" : "之後，我們就能四處旅行，賣掉商品賺取利潤！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Shakir]",
      "translation" : "[沙基爾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This way, business is more convenient and safe. Don't fall asleep, although it's too easy to do that.",
      "translation" : "這樣做生意既方便又安全。別睡著了，雖然真的很容易睡著。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sonya]",
      "translation" : "[索妮婭]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hey, you know, this one time I was walking through the forest and I saw this little green stem moving around.",
      "translation" : "嘿，你知道嗎？有一次我穿過森林時，看見一根綠色的小草莖在動。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sonya]",
      "translation" : "[索妮婭]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I went to see what it was and when I went to touch it. The stem actually slapped my hand!",
      "translation" : "我走過去想看看是什麼，還伸手去碰它。結果那根草莖竟然打了我的手！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sonya]",
      "translation" : "[索妮婭]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It startled me, so I jumped back a bit and then I realized it wasn't a stem, but a very small animal.",
      "translation" : "我嚇了一跳，往後跳開了一點，這才發現它不是草莖，而是一隻很小的動物。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sonya]",
      "translation" : "[索妮婭]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I was lucky I didn't upset it. Even the smallest animal can be dangerous if angered.",
      "translation" : "幸好我沒有惹怒它。即使是最小的動物，被激怒後也可能很危險。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You know those lazy looking bears that live in the forest on the way to Payon?",
      "translation" : "你知道通往斐揚的森林裡那些看起來懶洋洋的熊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sonya]",
      "translation" : "[索妮婭]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Just for fun, I threw a rock at it and all of sudden it rushed at me! I was sooooo scared, I started to run away, then BAM!!!",
      "translation" : "我只是想逗逗它，就朝它扔了塊石頭。沒想到它突然朝我衝過來！我嚇壞了，轉身就跑，接著砰的一聲！！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sonya]",
      "translation" : "[索妮婭]"
    },
